WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.815 --> 00:00:01.848
THE PRESIDENT SAID ABOUT IT

00:00:01.849 --> 00:00:02.916
ABOUT THE ACTING ATTORNEY

00:00:02.917 --> 00:00:03.249
GENERAL.

00:00:03.250 --> 00:00:04.718
BUT JUST IN THE PAST FEW

00:00:04.719 --> 00:00:05.318
MINUTES "THE WASHINGTON

00:00:05.319 --> 00:00:10.123
POST" HAS MOVED A PIECE THAT

00:00:10.124 --> 00:00:12.359
SAYS THE CIA CONCLUDES SAUDI

00:00:12.360 --> 00:00:14.928
CROWNED PRINCE ORDERED JAMAL

00:00:14.929 --> 00:00:15.829
KHASHOGGI'S ASSASSINATION

00:00:15.830 --> 00:00:16.997
THE SAUDI JOURNALIST KILLED

00:00:16.998 --> 00:00:19.366
IN THE SAUDI CONSULATE IN

00:00:19.367 --> 00:00:19.733
ISTANBUL.

00:00:19.734 --> 00:00:21.868
IF TRUE, AND WE HAVEN'T

00:00:21.869 --> 00:00:23.303
INDEPENDENTLY CONFIRMED

00:00:23.304 --> 00:00:24.237
THIS, ONE WOULD THINK THERE

00:00:24.238 --> 00:00:25.438
IS A LOT OF PRESSURE ON THE

00:00:25.439 --> 00:00:26.539
ADMINISTRATION TO HAVE SOME

00:00:26.540 --> 00:00:28.908
KIND OF DIFFERENT ANSWER,

00:00:28.909 --> 00:00:29.209
JONAH?

00:00:29.210 --> 00:00:32.212
&gt;&gt; YEAH.

00:00:32.213 --> 00:00:34.447
I IMAGINE DONALD TRUMP IS

00:00:34.448 --> 00:00:35.115
HAVING AN INTERESTING

00:00:35.116 --> 00:00:35.715
CONVERSATION ABOUT MIKE

00:00:35.716 --> 00:00:36.649
POMPEO ABOUT ALL OF THIS.

00:00:36.650 --> 00:00:38.518
AND I THINK IT SHOULD PROMPT

00:00:38.519 --> 00:00:45.091
A DIFFERENT APPROACH TO THE

00:00:45.092 --> 00:00:46.493
WAY WE HAVE DEALT WITH THE

00:00:46.494 --> 00:00:46.826
SAUDIS.

00:00:46.827 --> 00:00:48.561
THIS WAS A PLANNED

00:00:48.562 --> 00:00:49.896
ASSASSINATION FROM THE TOP

00:00:49.897 --> 00:00:50.830
IN POWER IN SAUDI ARABIA.

00:00:50.831 --> 00:00:51.998
YOU CAN'T SAY WE HAVE TO

00:00:51.999 --> 00:00:53.166
PROTECT OUR INTEREST AND

00:00:53.167 --> 00:00:55.268
DEFINE OUR INTERESTS SOLELY

00:00:55.269 --> 00:00:55.869
AS ARM SALES.

00:00:55.870 --> 00:00:56.970
WE HAVE OTHER INTERESTS

00:00:56.971 --> 00:00:57.670
INCLUDING THE RULE OF LAW

00:00:57.671 --> 00:00:59.239
AND THE IDEA THAT YOU ARE

00:00:59.240 --> 00:01:00.306
NOT SUPPOSED TO MURDER

00:01:00.307 --> 00:01:02.342
JOURNALISTS WHO ARE

00:01:02.343 --> 00:01:02.909
INCONVENIENT.

00:01:02.910 --> 00:01:03.543
&gt;&gt; Bret: QUICKLY, SUSAN?

00:01:03.544 --> 00:01:05.378
&gt;&gt; I'M NOT SURPRISED BUT

00:01:05.379 --> 00:01:06.212
CERTAINLY PUTS PRESSURE ON

00:01:06.213 --> 00:01:07.147
THE ADMINISTRATION TO DO

00:01:07.148 --> 00:01:08.181
MORE THAN IT'S DONE TO

00:01:08.182 --> 00:01:09.315
RESPOND TO THIS.

00:01:09.316 --> 00:01:10.950
&gt;&gt; YEAH, I TOTALLY CONCUR

00:01:10.951 --> 00:01:12.118
WITH THE TWO OF THEM.

00:01:12.119 --> 00:01:13.753
AND I THINK IT'S ALMOST TIME

00:01:13.754 --> 00:01:15.355
TO RELOOK AT OUR MIDDLE EAST

00:01:15.356 --> 00:01:16.423
POLICY, YOU KNOW, AT LARGE.

00:01:16.424 --> 00:01:17.657
WE ARE CONTINUING TO SEE

00:01:17.658 --> 00:01:19.025
JUST, YOU KNOW, THOUSANDS OF

00:01:19.026 --> 00:01:20.660
PEOPLE STILL OUT OF SYRIA.

00:01:20.661 --> 00:01:22.028
STILL CAN'T GET INTO THEIR

00:01:22.029 --> 00:01:22.395
HOMES.

00:01:22.396 --> 00:01:23.129
NO RESOLUTION THERE.

00:01:23.130 --> 00:01:26.400
AS WE SORT OF PIVOT TO CHINA

